WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
m -4 -4 l 1284 -4 1284 724 -4 724

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
WAR AT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
SEKIGAHARA

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
WAR AT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
SEKIGAHARA

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
WAR AT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.980
SEKIGAHARA

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.240
<i>Right when I can finally see
the guy I really want to fight...</i>

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.450
<i>I'll be damned if I let anything get in my way.</i>

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.740
<i>Right, Sanada Yukimura?!</i>

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:21.870
<i>Lord Masamune, I would like to
cross swords with you once more!</i>

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.370
<i>The fire burning in me cannot be stopped!</i>

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.540
We're going to get a little rough here!

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.880
Let's rumble party! Yeah!

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:44.600
<b>It is almost two point
five decades since I was born</b>

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.980
<b>I've had so many of jellos so far</b>

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:49.770
<b>and how many more will I swallow from now on?</b>

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:53.240
<b>I've already taken tons of exams</b>

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.700
<b>and what else is coming up to me from now on?</b>

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.870
<b>Daily lives must pass by quickly
without any "likes" and "hates"</b>

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.530
<b>That girl who falls for guys easily,</b>

00:01:00.530 --> 00:01:03.000
<b>fell for another one then another
one and another one each time</b>

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.410
<b>For a guy without such experience</b>

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Everyday life now is like a stormy river</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.880
<b>So fast!</b>

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:14.170
<b>Break out!</b>

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:22.560
<b>(so) I sing to myself before I get sunk</b>

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:27.440
<b>I jumped out to stop the streaming days</b>

00:01:27.440 --> 00:01:33.990
<b>The coastline I ran on that strong sunny day
(Shore line I ran)</b>

00:01:33.990 --> 00:01:38.660
<b>If you wanna take back that feeling
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:42.910
<b>That feeling and give it a deep color of your own self
(take back that feeling)</b>

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:45.830
<b>First, smash down that door</b>

00:01:54.970 --> 00:01:57.600
Kojuro, what the hell is that?

00:01:57.600 --> 00:01:59.430
The temple of Honnoji,
which burned to the ground

00:01:59.430 --> 00:02:02.480
along with Oda Nobunaga,
the Devil King of Owari...

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:04.940
But why is it here now?

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:09.730
One might even say this phenomenon
is already beyond human ken.

00:02:10.650 --> 00:02:12.860
Then, we're heading over there, too.

00:02:12.860 --> 00:02:15.320
I'm no dragon if I can't go beyond human ken!

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:16.700
You have my back!

00:02:16.700 --> 00:02:17.780
Yes, Sir!

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.250
What in the world is that ominous thing?

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:29.130
And yet, whoever it may be,

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:31.710
I will not allow them to
interfere with the fiery battles

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.050
that Lord Ishida, Lord Tokugawa,
and I are engaged in!

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.890
Curse you... Curse you...

00:02:41.890 --> 00:02:43.640
Curse you!

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:48.400
So, you would seek your master, too...

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.900
Mitsuhide...

00:02:49.900 --> 00:02:54.900
Life-and-Death

00:02:57.280 --> 00:02:58.780
What, what, what, what, what?

00:02:58.780 --> 00:03:00.660
What <i>is</i> this?

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:05.160
Lord Kingo, please help us!

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.500
I-I'm sorry...

00:03:06.500 --> 00:03:08.290
I can't!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.130
Venerable Tenkai!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:15.630
V-Venerable Tenkai!

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:22.390
No, no! No!

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:26.640
Venerable Tenkai!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.190
You may leave this man be.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:41.030
Are you in control of
those things, Venerable Tenkai?

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.200
Kingo, you should go back now.

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.960
To your own home.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:48.170
What about you, Venerable Tenkai?

00:03:48.170 --> 00:03:50.040
You must go!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.130
Venerable Tenkai!

00:03:54.130 --> 00:03:55.760
I'll be waiting!

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.680
I'll be waiting, okay?!

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.000
Sleep for now.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:30.080
Within this dark cocoon.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:47.520
Lord Nobunaga, I am awaiting your return.

00:04:53.440 --> 00:04:55.360
There's always more,
no matter how many I cut down!

00:04:55.360 --> 00:04:56.530
Keiji!

00:04:56.530 --> 00:04:59.740
There is no time for any grumbling here!

00:04:59.740 --> 00:05:01.450
Most powerful mercenaries!

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:04.280
Can't you guys do something about this?

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.910
Do not be ridiculous!

00:05:05.910 --> 00:05:07.910
Ghosts crawling up from the land of the dead...

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.210
No amount of bullets would suffice!

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.130
Our ammunition is running low as well.

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.540
Oh, dear...

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:17.630
When that time comes, I'll protect you!

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:21.050
I don't ever want to regret doing nothing again!

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.010
Maeda...

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.220
With the pride that I have
carried on from my predecessor...

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.560
We will now launch our attack!

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.350
Are you ready, men?!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.190
I've heard the rampaging
hoofbeat of this horse before...

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:43.320
I knew it! There he is! The One-Eyed Dragon!

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:44.780
And...

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:48.870
There's the Commander, too.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.290
Sasuke, are you unscathed?

00:05:50.290 --> 00:05:53.710
Hey there, Takeda ninja,
we're here for the same thing.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.590
We're going to show
these uninvited guests the exit.

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.840
Commander. One-Eyed Dragon.

00:05:58.840 --> 00:06:01.840
I understand. We can talk details later.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:05.260
For now, let these guys get to Honnoji Temple.

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:06.390
Magoichi?

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:07.930
Let Lady Saika?

00:06:08.600 --> 00:06:10.020
Please.

00:06:12.100 --> 00:06:14.100
Very well then.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:16.310
We will look to matters here.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.820
Go.

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.110
OK! You go on, Third Gen.

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:24.700
And take care of your unfinished business.

00:06:24.700 --> 00:06:25.950
I appreciate it.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.240
Leave the vanguard to me.

00:06:29.740 --> 00:06:31.290
Full-army charge!

00:06:31.290 --> 00:06:33.660
The enemy is at Honnoji Temple!

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:38.130
Sarutobi.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:40.130
Giving orders to Lord Masamune...

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:42.130
You've certainly come up in the world.

00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:45.050
Wh-Whoa-oh, you back to being a square?

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:47.510
N-Now, don't be like that.

00:06:47.510 --> 00:06:48.760
Look.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.940
They're both looking lively, aren't they?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:06:58.310
What the hell is that?

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:01.110
Things are getting dicey every which way I look.

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:11.700
Letting your attention
stray in the midst of battle...

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.910
You are a man who is as inattentive
to his surroundings as ever,

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.370
Chosokabe.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.880
And what about you?!

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:20.500
Always looking down at
everything from up on high!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.130
First thing I'm gonna do is
knock you down from there!

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:25.170
You are wasting your time.

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:28.470
I already know how this battle, too, will end.

00:07:28.470 --> 00:07:31.010
You cannot win against me.

00:07:36.350 --> 00:07:38.400
You took your time getting here.

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.190
It will be any moment now.

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:44.610
With the use of Lady O-Ichi's life,

00:07:44.610 --> 00:07:48.780
Lord Nobunaga, Devil King of
the Sixth Heaven, will be resurrected.

00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:50.240
What?!

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:55.750
Come! This maelstrom of chaos...

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.290
We will start over from the beginning.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.040
Recalling the battlefields that
I raced across with you back then

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:06.340
and at the end, that
excitement within those flames...

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:20.520
L-Lord Nobunaga...

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:26.320
The way you look... Why?!

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:29.240
Does this mean that I have failed?

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:35.370
I am the Devil King of the Sixth Heaven, O-Ichi.

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:41.960
It... I-I-It... It... I-I-I-It is not you...

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.630
L-Lady O-Ichi!

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:53.850
Men, take aim!

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:55.140
Hold on!

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:56.270
That's O-Ichi there!

00:08:56.270 --> 00:08:58.270
That is the Devil King!

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:01.900
A melding of misfortune and terror.
Something not human.

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:03.520
Move aside!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.730
But...

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:09.950
Keiji!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:12.490
Fire!

00:09:23.920 --> 00:09:25.420
Load the next round, quickly!

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:28.090
Fire every last bullet we have left!

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:37.560
Captain, we are out of ammunition!

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:42.100
All that I have left are these...

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.610
Lady O-Ichi, get a hold of yourself!

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:54.030
And take back your own self!

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:00.660
It is dangerous, so get back, Matsu!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:02.580
No, I will not get back!

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.330
I am a warrior's wife!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:07.090
My life? That much, I can protect myself!

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:11.340
Lady O-Ichi, if you continue this way,

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.340
you will end up losing everything!

00:10:14.890 --> 00:10:16.800
I no longer...

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:19.350
...have anything to lose.

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:20.640
Remember!

00:10:20.640 --> 00:10:23.440
That man who loved you!

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:25.600
Those days of fond memories!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:30.030
You cannot possibly have forgotten.

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:34.910
He was not the most artful of men,
but he loathed anything less than honest.

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:37.620
You often used to race
across the fields together.

00:10:37.620 --> 00:10:39.410
You looked happy.

00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.580
You and Lord Nagamasa.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:55.220
My lord Nagamasa...

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:59.680
Are you content to lose even
your memories of Lord Nagamasa?!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.680
No!

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.560
Now! Shoot, Magoichi!

00:11:08.560 --> 00:11:09.860
Keiji!

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.230
Maeda!

00:11:15.070 --> 00:11:16.660
Don't worry about it!

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:19.580
A man's life is meant to be
risked for the woman he loves!

00:11:19.580 --> 00:11:21.030
Keiji...

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.970
Lady O-Ichi!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.470
Keiji!

00:11:44.560 --> 00:11:46.270
Hey! Keiji!

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.940
Hang in there!

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.400
Goodness!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.130
Kasuga!

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:18.300
Took you long enough.

00:12:18.300 --> 00:12:21.800
But I came to save you, just like I promised.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:25.930
I only sleep within the
embrace of Lord Kenshin's arms.

00:12:34.360 --> 00:12:37.150
Maeda, time to go back.

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:39.660
Let me lie here for a little longer.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:43.280
Knowing your skills, I had faith
that you'd avoid hitting anything vital.

00:12:43.280 --> 00:12:48.210
But never mind that. You called
me Keiji earlier, instead of Maeda.

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:52.000
Come on, call me that again.

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:53.460
You goose.

00:12:54.540 --> 00:12:57.130
Lady O-Ichi is fine as well.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:01.260
Men, our mission is complete!

00:13:01.260 --> 00:13:04.260
We will now move to disengage!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.180
Make it so with all due haste!

00:13:12.440 --> 00:13:14.690
The ones who were in our way are gone now.

00:13:14.690 --> 00:13:16.780
We're enemies again.

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:19.860
Lord Masamune, I have the
promise you made at that tea house

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:22.740
etched upon my heart.

00:13:22.740 --> 00:13:23.870
That's right.

00:13:23.870 --> 00:13:27.950
In order to face you, there's something
I've got to surpass first, huh?

00:13:27.950 --> 00:13:31.330
The summit I aspire to is Date Masamune.

00:13:31.330 --> 00:13:34.630
That is my unwavering will!

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:38.300
Sanada Yukimura, my goal is you!

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:40.420
I won't lose sight of it again, either.

00:13:40.420 --> 00:13:43.640
Let's meet back here, once I've
become someone I can be proud of!

00:13:43.640 --> 00:13:45.800
It is a promise!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:06.070
Bam!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.080
I've finally found you!

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:14.750
Fuma!

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:17.790
Please wait!

00:14:17.790 --> 00:14:21.050
Please do not fight on my account!

00:14:21.050 --> 00:14:24.800
What's this?! Trying to get in
my humble self's way, you she-oracle?!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.680
No, the thing is...

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.260
Kuroda...

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:30.770
Um... So...

00:14:30.770 --> 00:14:34.190
I am sorry! That divination was my...

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:37.650
That is... A different
matter got mixed up in it...

00:14:37.650 --> 00:14:38.690
Squee!

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:41.230
What? He doesn't have the key?

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:42.690
The truth is, he does not...

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:43.490
Oh!

00:14:43.490 --> 00:14:45.160
There it is!

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:52.370
B-Bird?!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.500
How can this be?!

00:14:54.500 --> 00:14:57.630
What is up with my humble self's bad luck?!

00:14:57.630 --> 00:15:01.920
On second thought, humbly, I have great luck!

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:05.430
Just you wait, my humble self's key!

00:15:05.430 --> 00:15:07.010
Fire!

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.390
Ka-boom!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:13.060
Fare thee well!

00:15:14.520 --> 00:15:17.520
And now, we are alone,
just the two of us. Squee!

00:15:19.400 --> 00:15:24.030
The man of gloaming feathers!

00:15:24.030 --> 00:15:25.070
Wha...

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:27.530
Please wait!

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:37.120
I will allow no one to get to Mitsunari.

00:15:37.120 --> 00:15:40.500
To inflict further pain upon Mitsunari...

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:42.880
I will not stand for it!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:45.300
A beautiful friendship, eh?

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:48.130
You men would not understand.

00:15:48.130 --> 00:15:51.890
Lord Masamune, please
make haste to where Ishida is.

00:15:51.890 --> 00:15:55.180
Allow me, your second-in-command,
to take on this man.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.020
Kojuro, I'll leave this to you.

00:15:58.020 --> 00:15:59.350
Hold!

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:04.610
Your opponent is <i>me</i>!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:14.790
Lord Tokugawa.

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:17.080
So, you have stepped up, not as another warrior,

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:19.670
but as the commander of the Takeda.

00:16:19.670 --> 00:16:23.630
Sanada, this is truly as you were meant to be.

00:16:23.630 --> 00:16:25.880
I have kept you waiting a long time.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.590
People may someday call this battle

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:30.550
the fight over who would
be the Tiger's successor.

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:34.180
But I believe that it will
be something even greater.

00:16:34.180 --> 00:16:35.140
Yes.

00:16:35.140 --> 00:16:39.020
I, Sanada Genjiro Yukimura,
do challenge you to a fair fight!

00:16:39.020 --> 00:16:42.400
Behold the thrilling of my crimson soul!

00:16:42.400 --> 00:16:45.610
I must fight Mitsunari.

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:47.360
I will win this!

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:49.820
O Voracious Tiger, inheritor of the Takeda!

00:17:14.140 --> 00:17:15.600
That is...

00:17:17.020 --> 00:17:20.190
Looks like Sanada and Tokugawa
are locked in a struggle for supremacy.

00:17:20.190 --> 00:17:23.440
You sound calm. That is your commander there.

00:17:23.440 --> 00:17:26.570
Unlike you guys, we're equals in the east.

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:31.570
Besides, there's no commander
for me other than Lord Masamune.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:34.030
And right now,

00:17:34.030 --> 00:17:38.080
I'm not interested in anything
else except taking you down!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:39.960
That is...

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.620
So it's begun...

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.540
Do you not need to go?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:47.250
Knowing the man the commander
is now, he doesn't need my help.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:55.890
No time to be lookin' away, Master Tadakatsu!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:09.440
I sense it! The vital energy
of the Tiger within you!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:14.070
I, too, can sense the vital energy
of your Tiger, Lord Tokugawa!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.120
It comes through...

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.000
You must have struggled and
fought hard to face your demons!

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.580
I wrestled with it.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.040
We both revere Takeda Shingen as our mentor

00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:27.590
and yet, why were you and I so different?!

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.630
And did you realize why?

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:37.550
All I was doing was walking behind my lord.

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:40.680
But you had perceived...

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:44.390
...the spirit deep within my lord's bosom.

00:18:44.390 --> 00:18:45.690
Yes.

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:48.060
Lord Shingen has the strength of bonds.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.690
Lord Shingen's spirit wins the hearts of many,

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.150
forging bonds with those people.

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:57.570
You and I, and the people of Kai.

00:18:58.370 --> 00:19:00.290
I will go even further!

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:03.710
And I hope to forge bonds with <i>all</i>
the people of the land of the rising sun!

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:06.290
All? Is that...

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:08.500
...truly so?

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:14.130
My lord has crossed swords
with Lord Uesugi countless times

00:19:14.130 --> 00:19:16.340
and worked to forge a bond with him.

00:19:16.340 --> 00:19:18.890
Strengthening it with every fight.

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:21.310
But what you are doing...

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:25.980
It looks to me as though
you are severing those bonds!

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:29.110
What I have gazed upon...

00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:33.320
That is the heart of the Tiger,
which turns an honest gaze upon himself.

00:19:33.320 --> 00:19:37.820
As the elder Tiger's disciple,
I will now show this to you!

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:53.210
What will you do, Sanada?

00:19:57.550 --> 00:19:58.590
Wha...?!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.320
Shared bonds and heart...

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:21.910
Lord Shingen's spirit is vast...

00:20:21.910 --> 00:20:27.710
I wish to safeguard this spirit
that I have inherited from my lord.

00:20:27.710 --> 00:20:29.250
I see.

00:20:29.250 --> 00:20:32.250
Though I may be granted
half the land of the rising sun,

00:20:32.250 --> 00:20:34.840
my desire will not change.

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.590
<i>This</i> is the truth that is my flame

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:39.800
that echoes throughout
the heavens and the earth.

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:43.350
I see that you are the rightful Tiger's heir.

00:20:45.270 --> 00:20:46.640
Sanada?!

00:20:48.270 --> 00:20:49.980
Do not push yourself!

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.650
I will stand back up again
as many times as I must!

00:20:53.650 --> 00:20:56.730
My true feelings here in
my heart, my burning desire,

00:20:56.730 --> 00:20:59.820
urges me to fulfill
my promise with Lord Masamune!

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:04.490
You, too, must face your
true feelings deep within you.

00:21:04.490 --> 00:21:06.830
My true feelings...

00:21:10.540 --> 00:21:12.290
<i>The promise...</i>

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:18.170
You...

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:23.050
I've come to settle the score from that day.

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.970
Ishida Mitsunari!

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:32.650
<b>miageyou ima ano Polaris wo</b>

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:32.650
<b>Look up to that Polaris now</b>

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<b>kono shinzou wa kokoro wo motazu</b>

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:42.610
<b>My heart doesn' </b>t contain a spirit

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:47.080
<b>nemurenai toki wo kizamu dake da yo</b>

00:21:42.610 --> 00:21:47.080
<b>It merely marks the passage of sleepless hours</b>

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:50.870
<b>ryoute de tsuchi wo kakiatsumeta</b>

00:21:47.080 --> 00:21:50.870
<b>Scraping up bare earth with my two hands</b>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:56.130
<b>ano hito no kotoba made ume ya shinai zenshin koso</b>

00:21:50.870 --> 00:21:56.130
<b>won' </b>t fill the hole left by that person' s words

00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:00.920
<b>jouzu ni karada wo mushibande iku</b>

00:21:56.130 --> 00:22:00.920
<b>which are eating up my body</b>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.180
<b>hora goran yo ano Polaris wo</b>

00:22:04.720 --> 00:22:09.180
<b>Just look at that Polaris</b>

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:13.440
<b>uranometoria wo hirogetara</b>

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:13.440
<b>When you open the pages of the Uranometria</b>

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:21.570
<b>yogoreta tenohira ga kiten da to oshiete kureru</b>

00:22:13.440 --> 00:22:21.570
<b>It' </b>ll tell you your dirty hands are the reference point

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:26.740
<b>sagasu sagase yo kono samuzora ni</b>

00:22:22.070 --> 00:22:26.740
<b>Searching, searching the cold night sky</b>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:31.200
<b>anata no murui na kagayaki de</b>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:31.200
<b>for your exceptional brightness</b>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:44.800
<b>wazuka ni zahyou wo ushinawazu ni koko ni iru no ka</b>

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:44.800
<b>I would have lost the coordinates without you</b>

00:22:44.970 --> 00:22:49.970
Verdict

00:22:47.220 --> 00:22:49.970
Next time: Verdict
